codex
Implemented PI as a first-class Stage Agent harness.

Changed:
- `apps/backend/lib/config.ml`
- `apps/backend/lib/orchestrator.ml`
- `apps/backend/test/test_backend.ml`
- `docs/adr/0021-agent-harness-runtime-settings.md`
- `spec/spec-architecture-agent-harness-runtime-settings.md`

What changed:
- Added named `agents` harness parsing with `kind: "codex"` and `kind: "pi"`.
- Preserved legacy `codex` settings as the default Codex Harness.
- Made `agents.codex` canonical when both legacy `codex` and `agents.codex` exist.
- Added PI default command/model support and `<model>` / `<reasoning>` rendering.
- Routed Stage Agent dispatch through the selected harness.
- Made running-child turn/read/stall timeout handling harness-specific.
- Added readiness gaps for missing harnesses, invalid harness kinds, blank harness fields, and PI/non-Codex Stage Goal Handoff.
- Kept Stage Goal Handoff Codex-specific.
- Added backend tests for parsing, rendering, readiness, and PI launch selection.

Verification:
- `DUNE_BUILD_DIR=/private/tmp/symphony-dune-build-59d opam exec -- dune build --root . @all` passed.
- `DUNE_BUILD_DIR=/private/tmp/symphony-dune-build-59e opam exec -- dune runtest --root . apps/backend/test` passed: 130 tests.
- `git diff --check` passed for touched source/docs.
- `pnpm test` was attempted with an alternate Dune build dir, but pnpm failed with `[ERROR] fetch failed`.

Note: the worktree still has unrelated/pre-existing dirty files: `prompt.md`, `stdout.log`, `stderr.log`, and untracked `.pnpm-store/`.
